{"version":1,"title":"[長欣集]梅间 - SamuFlore","html":"<div class=\"l_main\" data-ui-surface=\"content\">\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"article-banner-wrap\"><div class=\"article banner top\">\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    \n    <div class=\"top bread-nav footnote\"><div class=\"top-row\"><div class=\"left\" id=\"breadcrumb\"><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">主页</a>\n<span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb\" href=\"/\">文章</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><a class=\"cap breadcrumb-link\" href=\"/categories/%E9%95%B7%E6%AC%A3%E9%9B%86/\">長欣集</a>\n</div><div class=\"right\"><span class=\"cap reading\">240 字 · 约 1 分钟</span></div></div><div class=\"meta-row\">\n<div class=\"flex-row preview-post-meta\" id=\"post-meta\"><a class=\"author\" href=\"/author/samuflore/\">Seymiris Asakawa</a><span class=\"sep\"></span><span class=\"text created\"><time datetime=\"2024-04-01T03:09:52.000Z\">2024-04-01</time></span><span class=\"sep updated\"></span><span class=\"text updated\">更新于：<time datetime=\"2026-02-19T05:44:50.264Z\">2026-02-19</time></span></div>\n</div></div>\n    \n    <div class=\"bottom only-title\">\n      \n      <div class=\"text-area\">\n        <h1 class=\"text title\"><span>[長欣集]梅间</span></h1>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n  </div>\n  </div></div>\n<article class=\"md-text content\"><div class=\"tag-plugin reel\"><div class=\"content\"><div class=\"title\">梅間</div><div class=\"body\"><div class=\"main\"><p>昔耀君之掌上兮、其東海之璇玉。何沖波之激迴兮、豈曉梅之易顔。<br>繁花下之闌珊兮、惟子清芬之襲予。雜亭蘭之碧露兮、養於長天之流輝。<br>嗚呼！<br>花濺淚之悲旋來兮、胡爲乎手足之離別？紫荊之折而謝地兮、蓮之褻玩而枝截。<br>叢菊之凄⺀然滿目兮、櫻之零⺀於四野。余旋踵而張皇兮、求梅君之於何方也？<br>奏流水而品茗兮、客拂袖而暮歸。庭灑掃以濯塵兮、二子相持而奔回。<br>朝飲<ruby>溷<rt>ㄏㄨㄣ㇔</rt></ruby>濁之川上兮、夕餐鬼魅之重圍。何風雲之易幻兮、夫惟舊日以焉追？<br>嗟乎！<br>竹間花之再會首兮、獨梅之復於迷途。余彷徨而反顧兮、恐卿之竟然踟躕。<br>既海晏而景明兮、展愁眉而顏開。薰風來以撫子衿兮、何夢覺之倏忽。</p></div></div><div class=\"date\">七十六年梅月一日</div><div class=\"footer\"></div></div></div></article>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n</div>","bodyClass":"content","layout":"post","type":"tech","textIndent":false}